==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|skera|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|skeranan|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈscɛːra/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛːra|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|skar|skáru|skorið}}

# to [[cut]], [[slice]], [[sever]]
# to [[chisel]]
# to [[carve]]
# to [[intersect]]
# {{rare|lang=is}} to [[guillotine]]

